+# Request accountability and revision status
+
+| Requirement | Outcome/location | Verification and unresolved issue |
+|---|---|---|
+| Advance original-record work | README CE40 recipient/notification targets and SF2442 answering-machine target | Primary released report representations read; native audio/table/notes/custody not acquired. |
+| Preserve source wording, values and distinctions | Receipt window, estimated duration, GTE belief, no-background/air-noise descriptions, caller assumptions and exact approximatePST message label retained | Paragraph/page/footer locators in SOURCE-PINS.json. No controlling clock/service or cause inferred. |
+| Preserve source links and original captures | Official part05 item; seven unchanged local viewer images with hashes | BrowserJPEG identity is not nativePDF/audio authentication. No raw capture/contact/private payload published. |
+| Avoid repeated searches and source-dependent overcounting | No public keyword query or denieddownload retry; bounded earlier-report/context lookup and new official item reading | No prior-report match in selected paths is not global novelty. Two pages of one CE40 account are not independent corroboration; separate records are not automatically the same call. |
+| Missing inputs stay TODOs while available work continues | OPEN-TODOS.json | All18 original acceptance requirements stay open/partial. No test completion from documentation. |
+| Respect privacy/redactions and ownership | Only relevant public report/form fields adopted | No masked recipient/agent/relative identity filled, unrelated personal form/ethnicity/photo fields published, mailbox/outreach/fee/experiment or technical-owner duplication. |
+| Publish as AveLyra with exact verification | Separate reviewed publication plan plus actual commit/push/API/SSH/allfile receipts | This checklist is not a push receipt; verify actual remote evidence before claiming success. |
+| Text diff and unchanged records | TEXT-CHANGES.diff against absent predecessor | New additive unit; earlier source reports remain unchanged. Capture verification is separate from text diff and historical/empirical testing. |
+
+No original waveform, system row, independent event clock, voice verification or physical test was obtained or performed. Reported message existence is kept separate from a claim of FBI custody. The broader goal remains active.
